* **Plausibility:** {{plausibility_text}} Winding temperature spans {{wind_min}}-{{wind_max}} °C; coolant {{cool_min}}-{{cool_max}} °C;
  ambient {{amb_min}}-{{amb_max}} °C.
* **Start state:** {{n_cold}} profiles start within 5 K of ambient, {{n_warm}} start warmer (up to {{max_start}} °C).
  A history buffer that starts empty on a warm motor is therefore a realistic situation, not an edge case.
* **Correlations (training profiles):** corr(winding, tooth) = {{corr_tooth}}, corr(winding, yoke) = {{corr_yoke}},
  corr(winding, magnet) = {{corr_pm}}: the other measured temperatures are almost collinear with the target,
  which is why they are **forbidden as inputs**. Instantaneous $i^2$ correlates only {{corr_isq}} with winding temperature.
* **Preprocessing:** float32 storage, no row deletion, no resampling of the raw series; derived features computed at the native rate;
  scaling only inside model pipelines, fitted on training rows.

